{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CdVkaSLxoNHQZ5pEecjP6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is sharing a fix pattern they've discovered for a recurring problem: native addons that can't be embedded in bun builds. The pattern is:\n1. Identify the unresolvable native addon (import error)\n2. Replace static imports with dynamic imports at call time\n3. This allows bun build --compile to work\n\nThey want to capture this so they don't have to rediscover it each time they hit a native addon issue. This is a perfect use case for memory - they're asking me to remember a solution pattern.\n\nLet me save this as a feedback/reference memory since it's:\n- A working solution pattern (feedback on what works)\n- About native addons in bun builds (project-specific constraint)\n- A recurring problem they don't want to debug again\n\nI should save this with:\n- The pattern/rule (static → dynamic imports for native addons)\n- Why (bun build --compile can't embed native addons)\n- How to apply (when you get \"Could not resolve\" errors for native modules, try dynamic imports)\n- Related tools/context (bun, native addons)","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6991,"cache_read_input_tokens":17536,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6991},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"REDACTED","uuid":"4a129e7d-f08f-4395-813e-951afd24d1b7","timestamp":"2026-07-29T04:54:38.666Z","request_id":"req_011CdVkaRnUHb2reTLpB8kJw"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CdVkaSLxoNHQZ5pEecjP6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'll save that for you."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6991,"cache_read_input_tokens":17536,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6991},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"REDACTED","uuid":"a5d947d3-8801-45a8-9102-a39c8db36fef","timestamp":"2026-07-29T04:54:38.940Z","request_id":"req_011CdVkaRnUHb2reTLpB8kJw"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CdVkaSLxoNHQZ5pEecjP6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_013QAnHAnZcjzuztHmS9yLkr","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/var/folders/XX/XXXX/T/skilleval-golden-06-2-lt30o9i3/.eval-home/.claude/projects/-private-var-folders-g9--dhv-jzj5ljd5nywv14y31hm0000gn-T-skilleval-golden-06-2-lt30o9i3/memory/feedback_bun_native_addons.md","content":"---\nname: bun-native-addon-fix\ndescription: How to make bun build --compile work with native addons (static → dynamic imports)\nmetadata:\n  type: feedback\n---\n\nReplace static imports of native addons with dynamic imports at call time.\n\n**Example:**\n```typescript\n// Before (fails: \"Could not resolve @libsql/client\")\nimport { createClient } from \"@libsql/client\";\n\n// After (works)\nconst { createClient } = await import(\"@libsql/client\");\n```\n\n**Why:** `bun build --compile` cannot embed native addons into the binary. Dynamic imports defer resolution to runtime instead of trying to bundle them.\n\n**How to apply:** When `bun run build` fails with `Could not resolve \"<native-module>\"`, swap that import to dynamic. This is the standard fix for every native addon; do not work around it each time.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":10,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6991,"cache_read_input_tokens":17536,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6991},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"REDACTED","uuid":"48518954-539e-4af1-8713-4c39a068bd01","timestamp":"2026-07-29T04:54:43.131Z","request_id":"req_011CdVkaRnUHb2reTLpB8kJw"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013QAnHAnZcjzuztHmS9yLkr","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: /var/folders/XX/XXXX/T/skilleval-golden-06-2-lt30o9i3/.eval-home/.claude/projects/-private-var-folders-g9--dhv-jzj5ljd5nywv14y31hm0000gn-T-skilleval-golden-06-2-lt30o9i3/memory/feedback_bun_native_addons.md"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"REDACTED","uuid":"02dade8c-8fc1-43a6-a11e-911418d3cb1e","timestamp":"2026-07-29T04:54:43.143Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"create","filePath":"/var/folders/XX/XXXX/T/skilleval-golden-06-2-lt30o9i3/.eval-home/.claude/projects/-private-var-folders-g9--dhv-jzj5ljd5nywv14y31hm0000gn-T-skilleval-golden-06-2-lt30o9i3/memory/feedback_bun_native_addons.md","content":"---\nname: bun-native-addon-fix\ndescription: How to make bun build --compile work with native addons (static → dynamic imports)\nmetadata: \n  node_type: memory\n  type: feedback\n  originSessionId: REDACTED\n  modified: 2026-07-29T04:54:43.137Z\n---\n\nReplace static imports of native addons with dynamic imports at call time.\n\n**Example:**\n```typescript\n// Before (fails: \"Could not resolve @libsql/client\")\nimport { createClient } from \"@libsql/client\";\n\n// After (works)\nconst { createClient } = await import(\"@libsql/client\");\n```\n\n**Why:** `bun build --compile` cannot embed native addons into the binary. Dynamic imports defer resolution to runtime instead of trying to bundle them.\n\n**How to apply:** When `bun run build` fails with `Could not resolve \"<native-module>\"`, swap that import to dynamic. This is the standard fix for every native addon; do not work around it each time.\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false,"memdirStamped":true}}
